<catalogue id="50ce-a1ff-19bf-1d2f" name="EpicAU - Knight Household" revision="1" battleScribeVersion="2.03" authorName="EpicAU Horus Heresy (community) - BSData conversion" authorContact="" authorUrl="https://web.archive.org/web/20201111221247/http://epicau.com/mw/index.php/Main_Page" library="false" gameSystemId="5924-e3fb-5543-3044" gameSystemRevision="1" xmlns="http://www.battlescribe.net/schema/catalogueSchema">
  <forceEntries>
    <forceEntry id="1897-edf7-b72c-17af" name="Knight Household" hidden="false">
      <rules>
        <rule id="d310-77d6-830e-bed4" name="Army List" hidden="false">
          <description>Strategy Rating 3. Formation initiative 2.
2 Support Detachments may be taken per Line Detachment.
Detachments may choose any number of upgrades, each only once.
The wiki sets no Allies/Lords of War limit for Knight Household; 1/3 is used, matching Departmento Munitorum.
Cohesive allies: Legio Titanicus, Mechanicum Taghmata.
Disruptive allies: Imperial Militia, Legion Astartes, Solar Auxilia.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
