    <forceEntry id="5521-9b5d-234d-12f8" name="Knight Household (Allied Contingent)" hidden="false">
      <rules>
        <rule id="8b67-2d36-390b-48bf" name="Army List" hidden="false">
          <description>Strategy Rating 3. Formation initiative 2.
2 Support Detachments may be taken per Line Detachment.
Detachments may choose any number of upgrades, each only once.
The wiki sets no Allies/Lords of War limit for Knight Household; 1/3 is used, matching Departmento Munitorum.
Cohesive allies: Legio Titanicus, Mechanicum Taghmata.
Disruptive allies: Imperial Militia, Legion Astartes, Solar Auxilia.
Allied Contingent: formations here count towards the primary army's Allies &amp; Lords of War allowance. Supreme Commanders must come from the primary army.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
